The isolation of bacteria were made by serial dilution and cultured on nutrient agar. Were taken 0.5 gm of soil
sample was added in to 10 ml of sterile distilled water and mixed for 1 min with a vortex. This mixture is serially
dilluted from 10-1 to 10-8, 1 mL of each dilution (10−3 to 10−7) was spread on nutrient rich (NR) agar (Hi-Media)

