 hossain2024-rice-cadmium-soil-ph,wiki/sources,AUTO_auto-salt-cd-product_2024_10-53808-kus-2024-21-01-1133-ls,pending,2026-06-09T00:00:00Z,audited-revised,REVISE,2026-06-09,"Autonomous audit cycle: Checks 4/5 clean; Check 1 ⚠️ (Heera 1% OM soil-bioavailable was unfilled placeholder; pH headline values omitted); Check 2 ❌ (mitigation/cadmium-soil-management invented slug); Check 3 ⚠️ (Methods underspecified). Applied: replaced mitigation/cadmium-soil-management with mitigation/agronomic (existing page covers soil pH + OM levers); expanded Key numbers with full Table 2 (pH series, 4 cultivars × 3 pH) and full Table 3 (OM series including Heera 0.59 mg/kg soil-bioavailable Cd); added TF and HQ summary (HQ>1 except BRRI 28 at 3% OM); expanded Methods with Shimadzu AAS AA-7000, HNO3:HClO4 (2:1) at 180°C, STATISTIX v10.0, QA/QC details (permitted per 2026-05-17 scientific-method exception); added Verification note clarifying sample_n=36 basis (4 varieties × 3 pH × 3 OM unique cells) and cultivar-not-brand status. Routing audit clean (not in unresolved/malformed). No rejected findings; no independent-verification catches beyond audit findings."
